797
01:07:53,277 --> 01:07:54,277
Thank you, Nerissa! Thank you! Thank you!

798
01:07:58,777 --> 01:08:01,077
モコちゃんは、モコちゃんはちょっと……分からなくなっちゃったけども。
Mococo was... Mococo was...

799
01:08:03,777 --> 01:08:08,777
でも、やっぱ近しい動機とかに聞かれるのは恥ずかしい、恥ずかしい！
Still, you know, being asked by close-running motives is embarrassing, embarrassing.

800
01:08:14,277 --> 01:08:19,277
でもモコちゃん長文でね、そう、丁寧に送ってくれてね！
Mococo wrote it so long and carefully for us, you know?

801
01:08:20,777 --> 01:08:22,777
Thank you so much! Thank you so much!
Thank you so much!

802
01:08:26,077 --> 01:08:27,277
はい、今日もね、
And so today,

803
